        "modifier_2": "none",
        "background_color": "none",
        "section_id": "",
        "heading": "<h2>Go beyond surface-level haircare</h2>",
        "text": "<p>Traditional serums sit on top of the scalp or rinse away. Once a week, the Micro-Infusion Pro Hair System uses 0.5mm 24k gold-plated needles to create tiny micro-channels, <strong>designed to help deliver serum actives directly to the scalp surface where they're needed most.</strong> On the days in between, the Hair Renewal Serum keeps your scalp conditioned.</p><p>The patent-pending system uses tiny, virtually painless, microneedles penetrate beyond the skin’s surface increasing serum absorption and delivering powerful active ingredients exactly where they’re needed!</p><p><strong>How Qure refreshes your skin in 3 easy steps:</strong></p><p>[step]</p><ul><li><strong>Stamp<br/></strong>Virtually painless micro-stamping with 0.5mm needles on a sterile, single-use tip.</li><li><strong>Infuse<br/></strong>Designed to help deliver serum actives directly to the scalp surface.</li><li><strong>Renews<br/></strong>Supports the look of fuller, denser-looking hair over time.</li></ul>",
        "button_label": "",
