    "n_faq_AE8YPK": {
      "type": "n_faq",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_benefit": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use this after clinical microneedling?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The Recovery+ Sheet Mask is formulated to mirror the cooling protocol used in clinics after treatments like Dermapen and SkinPen. It's made for freshly treated, sensitized skin, so it suits post-treatment care whether you've had an at-home Micro-Infusion session or a clinical microneedling treatment. If you're ever unsure, check with your provider first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_showerheads": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I use it?",
            "text": "<p>Once a week works well for most people, in line with a weekly Micro-Infusion routine — each box holds 6 masks, a 3-month supply. You can also reach for it any time skin feels dry, stressed, or in need of extra care, even outside your treatment days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_pressure": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why shouldn't I wash it off?",
            "text": "<p>The serum is formulated to keep working after you remove the mask. Rinsing washes away the moisture and calming actives before they've had a chance to fully absorb. Instead, pat any leftover serum into your skin, leave it on overnight, and cleanse as normal the next morning.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_certified": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it contain synthetic fragrance?",
            "text": "<p>No. The Recovery+ Sheet Mask is fragrance-free, and also free from parabens and PEG — made for sensitive, reactive, and freshly treated skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_replace": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it suitable for sensitive skin?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. It's dermatologist tested, hypoallergenic, and formulated to be non-irritating — including on sensitive and reactive skin. If you have a specific skin condition or aren't sure, it's worth checking with your dermatologist first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_install": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the key ingredients?",
            "text": "<p>The mask is built around a hydrating and calming actives stack: Polyglutamic Acid and Sodium Hyaluronate to draw in and hold moisture, Centella Asiatica (Cica) and Beta-Glucan to help calm the appearance of redness, and Ectoin and Allantoin to help soothe and support skin's barrier.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_subscribe": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use it even if I haven't done Micro-Infusion?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. While it's formulated for post-Micro-Infusion recovery, it also works well on its own, anytime skin feels dry, stressed, or in need of extra care — no treatment required.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "accordion_benefit",
